<doc id="20070" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20070" title="Elba">
Elba

Elba nyaéta salasahiji &lt;a href="pulo"&gt;pulo&lt;/a&gt; di &lt;a href="Toscana"&gt;Toscana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Italia"&gt;Italia&lt;/a&gt;, 20&amp;nbsp;km ti kota &lt;a href="Grosseto"&gt;Grosseto&lt;/a&gt;. Pulo ieu mangrupa pulo panggedéna di &lt;a href="Semenanjung%20Toscana"&gt;Semenanjung Toscana&lt;/a&gt;, sarta mangrupa pulo panggedéna katilu di Italia. Elba jeung pulo lianna di semenanjung éta (&lt;a href="Pianosa"&gt;Pianosa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Capraia"&gt;Capraia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Montecristo"&gt;Montecristo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Giglio"&gt;Giglio&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Giannutri"&gt;Giannutri&lt;/a&gt;) ditangytayungan di Taman Nasional Semenanjung Toscana.
Pulo ieu dibagi jadi dalapan komun: kota ibu kota &lt;a href="Portoferraio"&gt;Portoferraio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Campo%20nell%27Elba"&gt;Campo nell'Elba&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Capoliveri"&gt;Capoliveri&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Marciana"&gt;Marciana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Marciana%20Marina"&gt;Marciana Marina&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Porto%20Azzurro"&gt;Porto Azzurro&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Rio%20Marina"&gt;Rio Marina&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Rio%20nell%27Elba"&gt;Rio nell'Elba&lt;/a&gt;.
Kaisar &lt;a href="Perancis"&gt;Perancis&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Napoleon%20Bonaparte"&gt;Napoleon Bonaparte&lt;/a&gt; dipiceun ka Elba nalika dilengserkeun (munggaran), nginspirasian sabaet &lt;a href="palindrom"&gt;palindrom&lt;/a&gt; nu kasohor: "Able was I ere I saw Elba."
Kiwari Elba kasohor ku &lt;a href="Anggur%20%28inuman%29"&gt;anggurna&lt;/a&gt;.

