<doc id="20170" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20170" title="Noam Chomsky">
Noam Chomsky

Ngaran lengkepna Noam Avram Chomsky, lahir di &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sarikat"&gt;Amérika Sarikat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="7%20D%C3%A9s%C3%A9mber"&gt;7 Désémber&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1928"&gt;1928&lt;/a&gt;. Réputasi fénoménal Chomsky di widang &lt;a href="linguistik"&gt;linguistik&lt;/a&gt; atra katitén ku jalan téorina ngeunaan &lt;a href="generative%20grammar"&gt;generative grammar&lt;/a&gt; (Tata Basa Generatif Struktural). Kaparigelan jeung kaahlian di widang linguistik ieu jadi panganteur manéhna ngambah kana studi &lt;a href="pulitik"&gt;pulitik&lt;/a&gt;.
Profesor Linguistik di M.I.T ieu geus nulis leuwih ti 30 &lt;a href="buku"&gt;buku&lt;/a&gt; pulitik, kalawan rupa-rupa judul. Sarta saprak 1965 nepi ka kiwari, Noam Chomsky ngajanggélék jadi salah sahiji figur "pang dipikasieunna" ku pamaréntah &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sarikat"&gt;Amérika&lt;/a&gt; lantaran kakritisannya kana kawijakan luar negeri Amérika.
Karya-karyanya, di antarana: 
<ul>
<li>The Fateful Triangle: The United States, Israél, and the Palestinians;</li>
<li>New Military Humanism: Lessons from Kosovo;</li>
<li>Powers and Prospects: Reflections on Human Nature and the Social Order;</li>
<li>Rethinking the Camelot: JFK, The Vietnam War, and U.S. Political Culture;</li>
<li>Yéar 501: The Conquest Continues;</li>
<li>Deterring Democracy;</li>
<li>Necessary Illusions: Thought Control in Democratic Societies.</li>
</ul>

</doc>
