<h2>Munggaran: 3 Juli 2007</h2>
Munggaran: 3 Juli 2007.
Dina &lt;a href="3%20Juli"&gt;3 Juli&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;, perang pakarang kajadian antara nu ngarojong Lal Masjid ngalawan angkatan kaamanan Pakistan sanggeus genep bulan eureun antara dua pihak. Bentrokan dimimitian nalika sababaraha militan nyoba nempatan wangunan pamaréntah deukeuteunnana. 150 urang murid nyerang kantor &lt;a href="Pamar%C3%A9ntah%20Pakistan"&gt;Pamaréntah Pakistan&lt;/a&gt; deukeuteun &lt;a href="masjid"&gt;masjid&lt;/a&gt; sarta nahan opat urang &lt;a href="pagaw%C3%A9"&gt;pagawé&lt;/a&gt; minangka &lt;a href="sandera"&gt;sandera&lt;/a&gt;. Subsequently he called for attacks on the forces, and students of the &lt;a href="Lal%20Masjid"&gt;Lal Masjid&lt;/a&gt; had taken over certain &lt;a href="Government%20of%20Pakistan"&gt;government&lt;/a&gt; posts and had attacked government buildings.
9 péople, including mosque students, media persons, a &lt;a href="Pakistan%20Rangers"&gt;Pakistan Rangers&lt;/a&gt; personnel and a businessman were killed while over 100 are injured in the incident.
<h2>4 July 2007</h2>
4 July 2007.
Over one hundred students of Jamia Hafsa surrendered before the authorities on July 4, 2007. The Pakistani government announced &lt;a href="Pakistani%20Rupee"&gt;Rs.&lt;/a&gt; 5000 as part of their travel arrangements to their homes.
